    "Give shoulders a small volume boost: 4 sets is enough to maintain, but for long-term muscle building you'd benefit from 5 to 6 sets. Consider adding one shoulder isolation movement, like a lateral raise, to a pressing day.",
    "Protect your recovery: last period's note flagged watching recovery, and with every muscle group progressing this hard, sleep quality and daily protein intake are the levers most likely to determine whether you sustain this trajectory or start to stall in the coming weeks."
  ],
  "contextSummary": "All six muscle groups hit new strength index highs this period with gains of 4 to 7 points each; volume is well distributed but biceps and shoulders are slightly under-served relative to other groups."
